# Save work to GitHub automatically

This repo must stay backed up on `origin` (https://github.com/KyryloY/rag-fastapi). Do not wait for a reminder.

## After any completed slice of work

1. Stage the relevant files (not secrets).
2. Create a commit with an English message that says why.
3. Push the current branch to `origin` immediately (`git push -u origin HEAD`).
4. If work landed on a feature branch that `main` should also have, merge into `main` and push `origin/main` too so the default GitHub branch is not stale.

## Never commit

- `.env`, API keys, credentials
- Chroma / `data/indexes/` / local caches
- `.venv/`, `__pycache__/`, `.superpowers/` scratch

## Do not wait

Do not leave finished code, docs, or rule files only on disk. If `git status` is dirty after you finish a task, commit and push in the same turn.
